---

This project vendors unmodified Python standard library modules from CPython
3.14 under `bench/programs/`: difflib, textwrap, fractions, shlex,
configparser, and fnmatch. They are used as subjects for the benchmark and are
copied verbatim.

Those files are covered by the Python Software Foundation License, which
governs the Python standard library, and are NOT covered by the MIT terms
above. The PSF license is reproduced at
https://docs.python.org/3/license.html and the governing notice is retained
here:

